    "description": "Two BoL-scaling weapons (Flowing Purity catalyst / Finale of the Deep sword), wielder-self: toStat += min(ratio[R] × hp_total × (settings[weapon_*_bol]/100), cap[R]) via PostEffectStatsBondOfLife (raw/.../classes/PostEffect/Stats/BondOfLife.js + the two weapon files). Flowing Purity: 7×dmg_<el> ratio [.002,.0025,.003,.0035,.004] cap [12,15,18,21,24] (StatTable '', cap NOT percent-folded; dmg_<el> IS so value+cap fold /100 → human-% = min(ratio×hp×BoL/100, cap)); only the WIELDER's own element binds on direct hits (Klee=pyro). Finale: atk ratio [.024,.03,.036,.042,.048] cap [150,187.5,225,262.5,300] (flat ATK, no fold; lifts ALL ATK-scaling damage). BoL is a per-weapon UI setting folded /100 in getBolValue (NOT common.bond_of_life); weaponPassiveOn sets the flat-refine CHECKBOX but SKIPS the BoL ConditionNumberLevels, so each item binds weapon_*_bol via setBuffsSettings (else BoL=0 → gamed gate). 4 fixtures (2 weapons × {R1,R5}) on sampleStats reps (Klee/Keqing): {FP-R1 BoL10=4.70% LINEAR, FP-R5 BoL50=24% CAPPED, Finale-R1 BoL10=63.19atk LINEAR, Finale-R5 BoL30=300atk CAPPED}. RED until Task B wires the BoL post-effect (the TS weapon files carry no postEffects today).",
